WEBVTT

00:16.868 --> 00:23.452
The screen went dark without a single sound I'm

00:23.512 --> 00:28.394
searching for a signal that cannot be found

00:31.136 --> 00:38.939
I checked the routing I ran the trace But there is

00:39.059 --> 00:43.302
just a shadow in your physical space

00:45.703 --> 00:50.226
No warning lights, no system alert

00:52.948 --> 00:57.791
Just the sudden, silent gravity of the hurt

01:00.293 --> 01:04.876
It's an unhandled exception in the dead of night

01:07.108 --> 01:14.533
A catastrophic failure A fading of the light I'm

01:14.573 --> 01:18.996
reaching through the wire But the endpoint is

01:19.056 --> 01:26.681
gone How do I process When the system stays on?

01:39.558 --> 01:43.900
The phalanx is ready, but there's nothing to

01:43.920 --> 01:51.203
fight You can't build a wall against the absence

01:51.323 --> 01:55.818
of light Player 2 holds my head as the

01:55.898 --> 01:59.198
temperature drops We wait for the ping but the

01:59.298 --> 02:02.779
heartbeat just stops I keep checking the

02:02.879 --> 02:07.360
dictionary line by line Begging the beat before

02:07.420 --> 02:11.982
a single sign It's an unhandled exception in the

02:12.042 --> 02:18.275
dead of the night A catastrophic failure A

02:19.196 --> 02:24.361
fading of the light I'm reaching through the

02:24.401 --> 02:32.188
wire But the end point is gone How do I process

02:33.069 --> 02:38.825
When the system stays on? I don't care about the

02:38.865 --> 02:41.907
network I don't care about the code I am just a

02:41.967 --> 02:45.751
broken man at the end of the road I never got to say

02:45.791 --> 02:49.333
goodbye I never understood why I am sitting in

02:49.353 --> 02:52.756
the wreckage just watching the sky It just hurts

02:53.377 --> 02:59.602
God, it hurts that you're gone And I don't know

03:00.242 --> 03:03.285
how I am supposed to move on

03:34.356 --> 03:38.298
It's an unhandled exception In the dead

03:40.659 --> 03:46.702
of the night A catastrophic failure A fading of

03:46.782 --> 03:51.844
the light I'm reaching through the wire But the

03:51.904 --> 03:59.328
end point is gone How do I process When the system

03:59.348 --> 04:03.810
